# OriginOS / vivo / iQOO 字体槽
# 拉丁/数字/谷歌部分为标准 AOSP 命名；中文 vivo-sans 槽为常见命名，
# 安装时会扫描真机 /system/fonts 等目录，把实际存在的 VivoSans/OriginSans/iQOOSans 一并并入
Roboto-Thin.ttf
Roboto-ExtraLight.ttf
Roboto-Light.ttf
Roboto-Regular.ttf
Roboto-Medium.ttf
Roboto-SemiBold.ttf
Roboto-Bold.ttf
Roboto-ExtraBold.ttf
Roboto-Black.ttf
RobotoFlex-Regular.ttf
RobotoStatic-Regular.ttf
GoogleSans-Regular.ttf
GoogleSans-Medium.ttf
GoogleSans-SemiBold.ttf
GoogleSans-Bold.ttf
GoogleSansText-Regular.ttf
GoogleSansText-Medium.ttf
GoogleSansText-SemiBold.ttf
GoogleSansText-Bold.ttf
GoogleSansFlex-Regular.ttf
NotoSans-Regular.ttf
# vivo 中文（常见命名，真机扫描会补全其余字重）
VivoSans-Thin.ttf
VivoSans-Light.ttf
VivoSans-Regular.ttf
VivoSans-Medium.ttf
VivoSans-SemiBold.ttf
VivoSans-Bold.ttf
VivoSansVF.ttf
VivoSansCondensed-Regular.ttf
VivoSansCondensed-Medium.ttf
VivoSansCondensed-Bold.ttf
vivoSans-Regular.ttf
OriginSans-Regular.ttf
iQOOSans-Regular.ttf
